cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release below. If you use the bundled connectome data, please also cite the FlyWire publications listed in the README."
type: software
title: "LiquidAion Neural Observatory"
abstract: >-
  Experimental research software that couples a frozen pretrained language model
  (Qwen3-0.6B) bidirectionally to a sparse recurrent rate network whose connectivity
  is a 512-neuron subset of the adult Drosophila melanogaster connectome (FlyWire FAFB,
  materialization 783). It provides a desktop observatory with an anatomically registered
  3D view, controlled same-prefix experiments (coupling, random-topology control,
  persistent versus reset state), session recording and replay, and diagnostics for
  context isolation and repetition. Version 0.3.0 adds selectable Qwen3 models, multi-layer
  Neural Bypass, Python experiment plugins, steering and leak-rate diagnostics, and a
  plugin-first architecture in which the neural interface, coupling policy, connectome,
  reservoir dynamics and GUI panels are replaceable components.
